<%- include('partials/header') %>
<div class="container">
    <h1>UMBRELLA RISE & FALL</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--terminal-white); margin-bottom: 2rem;">1968-2003 // CORPORATE TIMELINE // T-VIRUS LEGACY</p>
    
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="/timeline" class="timeline-btn <%= title === 'INCIDENT TIMELINE' ? 'active' : '' %>">MAIN TIMELINE</a>
        <a href="/timeline/bsaa-corruption" class="timeline-btn <%= title === 'BSAA CORRUPTION TIMELINE' ? 'active' : '' %>">BSAA CORRUPTION</a>
        <a href="/timeline/wesker-legacy" class="timeline-btn <%= title === 'WESKER LEGACY TIMELINE' ? 'active' : '' %>">WESKER LEGACY</a>
        <a href="/timeline/umbrella" class="timeline-btn <%= title === 'UMBRELLA RISE & FALL' ? 'active' : '' %>">UMBRELLA RISE & FALL</a>
    </div>
    
    <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">1968 // UMBRELLA FOUNDED</div>
            <p>Ozwell Spencer, James Marcus, Edward Ashford establish Umbrella as pharmaceutical front.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">1960s-1970s // VIRUS DEVELOPMENT</div>
            <p>Progenitor virus discovered. Marcus develops T-Virus at Arklay facility.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">1988 // MARCUS' DEATH</div>
            <p>Spencer orders Marcus killed. T-Virus research continues under Birkin.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">1998 // ARKLAY INCIDENT</div>
            <p>Mansion incident. S.T.A.R.S. expose Umbrella's B.O.W. research.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">1998 // RACCOON CITY</div>
            <p>T-Virus outbreak destroys Raccoon City. Umbrella exposed globally.</p>
            <span class="threat-level CRITICAL">PUBLIC EXPOSURE</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">2003 // UMBRELLA FALLS</div>
            <p>Umbrella declared guilty of bioterrorism. Stock crashes. Company dissolved.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="timeline-year">2003-PRESENT // UMBRELLA LEGACY</div>
            <p>Remnants appear as Neo-Umbrella. Former employees scattered. Technology still in use.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>